<createdBy>stb</createdBy>
<createdTime>2020-02-03 20:18:16 UTC</createdTime>
<comment><![CDATA[Element a buiness rule references.
The level of the business rule is derived from the type of elements if references:
ATTRIBUTE-LEVEL	1 attribute of one entity
ROW-LEVEL	>1 attributes of one entity (including attributes from FK-connected row)
ENTITY-LEVEL	1 entity, no attributes
DATABASE-LEVEL	>1 entity, no attributes or > 1 attributes from more than one entity (not FK-connected)]]></comment>
